@startuml p1ExtractData
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
  p1ExtractData
end title

participant "requestor\n" as requestor
participant "p1ExtractData\n" as pFF

requestor -> pFF : { {DataStructure}, fieldsFilterString}
activate pFF
  note over pFF
    Applies the fieldsFilterString to the given DataStructure object,
    following the NETCONF FieldsFilter syntax and semantics.
    This includes the uuids and localIds being present in the filtered
    DataStructure, if any of their child elements are kept by the filter.

    Creates an empty object, then successively copies relevant data
    from the input DataStructure into the object.
  end note

requestor <-- pFF : { {filteredDataStructure} }
deactivate pFF

@enduml